const Tira:React.FC<{id:string;x:number;y:number;n:number;cw:number;ch:number;gum?:number;year?:boolean;op?:number}>=({id,x,y,n,cw,ch,gum=0,year=false,op=1})=>{
 const nn=Math.max(0,n),full=Math.floor(nn),cells:React.ReactNode[]=[];
 for(let j=0;j<=full&&j<100;j++){const w=j===full?nn-full:1;if(w<=.02)break;
  const h=ch*(1-gum*.32*Math.sin(Math.PI*Math.min(1,j/Math.max(nn,1))));
  const col=j<48?(j%12===0?'#e6a300':L):(j%12===0?'#d62a2a':RJ);
  cells.push(<rect key={j} x={x+j*cw+1} y={y-h/2} width={Math.max(0,cw*w-2)} height={h} rx={Math.min(5,cw/4)} fill={col}/>);}
 return <g opacity={op}>
  <rect x={x} y={y-ch/2+14} width={nn*cw} height={ch} fill='#000' opacity={.4} filter='url(#b18)'/>
  {cells}
  <rect x={x} y={y-ch/2} width={nn*cw} height={ch} fill='url(#tiraV)'/>
  {year&&Array.from({length:Math.floor(nn/12)}).map((_,m)=><g key={m}><rect x={x+(m+1)*12*cw-2} y={y-ch/2-12} width={4} height={ch+24} fill={NAVY}/><Txt x={x+(m*12+6)*cw} y={y+ch/2+52} t={'AÑO '+(m+1)} size={34} fill='#fff' stroke={NAVY} sw={7} sombra={false}/></g>)}
  <ellipse cx={x+nn*cw} cy={y} rx={9} ry={ch/2} fill={nn>48?'#ff8a8a':'#ffe27a'} opacity={.9}/>
  {nn>48&&<circle cx={x+nn*cw} cy={y} r={ch*.8} fill={RJ} opacity={.28} filter='url(#b18)'/>}
 </g>;
};
